<title>HONG KONG: Mei Ah mulls investment in China studio.</title>
<headline>Mei Ah mulls investment in China studio.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Movie video distributor Mei Ah International Ltd said on Tuesday it was considering an investment in a studio in the southern Chinese city of Guangzhou, across the border from Hong Kong.</p>
<p>&quot;The company is now in the process of investigating an opportunity to invest indirectly in the Oriental Studio 2000 which is located at Guangzhou,&quot; chairman Li Kuo Hsing said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The company may or may not proceed with this investment,&quot; Li added.</p>
<p>Mei Ah shares rose HK$0.125 or 5.43 percent to HK$2.425 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
